    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle. Sio bi\u00fe adla ricust abitera\u00f0 se lichoma eall & ageolwa\u00fe swa god geolo seoluc. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe w\u00e6ter bollan. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 canceradle, \u00fe\u00e6t is bite, & smerenessa & sealf, feower cr\u00e6ftas. L\u00e6cedomas & drencas wi\u00fe \u00e6lcum attre, wi\u00f0 n\u00e6dran slege & bite & slite & wi\u00fe \u00feon gif mon atter Gif hwa gedrince wyrm on w\u00e6tere wi\u00fe \u00feon l\u00e6cedomas & gif mon forboren sie, ealles XX cr\u00e6fta wi\u00f0 L\u00e6cedomas gif anawyrm on men weaxe, sealf, drenc & clam wi\u00fe \u00feon. V l\u00e6cedomas \u00fe\u00e6s sint. L\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealfa wi\u00fe \u00feeoradlum moniges cynnes, \u00fea betstan wi\u00fe \u00feeorwyrme on fet, L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feam wyrmum \u00fee innan egla\u00f0 monnum & wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee on cilda inno\u00fee beo\u00fe & L\u00e6cedom on sundron anlipig wi\u00fe \u00feam smalan wyrme. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe hand wyrmum & deaw wyrmum & gif wyrm hand ete, weaxsealf wi\u00fe hand wyrme, L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee monnes fl\u00e6sc eta\u00fe. L\u00e6cedomas twegen wi\u00fe lusum. L\u00e6cedomas twegen wi\u00fe smoega wyrmum. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 wyrm\u00e6tum lice & cweldehtum. L\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe aslegenum lice. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe aslapenum lice & b\u00e6\u00fe sealf. L\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealfa wi\u00fe fice. L\u00e6cedomas to wen sealfe & to wen bylum. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 paralisin",
